<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, APRIL 29.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK CENTRAL BANK FIXING RATES, APRIL 29.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece's fixing rates</p>
<p>for leading currencies on Tuesday were as follows.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> Currency:    April 29    April 24   Dec 31 96    NET</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>- USD =	  274.400     272.900     247.020   11.08 %</p>
<p>- ECU =	  309.400     309.180     306.830    0.84 %</p>
<p>- DEM =	  158.425     158.770     158.970   -0.34 %</p>
<p>- FRF =	   47.008	47.096	47.182   -0.37 %</p>
<p>- GBP =	  445.140     441.860     419.180    6.19 %</p>
<p>- NLG =	  140.925     141.190     141.685   -0.54 %</p>
<p>- ITL (100) =   15.984	16.009	16.185   -1.24 %</p>
<p>- JPY (100) =  216.610     216.340     212.430    1.97 %</p>
<p>- ESP =	    1.882	 1.886	 1.888   -0.32 %</p>
<p>- PTE =	    1.582	 1.583	 1.581    0.06 %</p>
<p>- CHF =	  186.325     186.120     183.135    1.74 %</p>
<p>Note: The percentage net change is calculated as the percentage</p>
<p>difference between the most recent fixing rate and the December</p>
<p>31, 1996 rate.</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
